## Import

Perf Advisor endpoints can be imported using the endpoint UUID:

```sh
terraform import yba_perf_advisor_endpoint.standalone <endpoint-uuid>
```

YugabyteDB Anywhere does not return the passwords, so import leaves both
`password` fields empty. When the configuration sets a password, the first plan
after import shows an in-place update. That apply sends the configured passwords
and changes nothing else.
